      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S105SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S105EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Hechicero\n\r\u0022\u00A1Maestro! Aqu\u00ED hay en funcionamiento extra\u00F1as fuerzas de lo oculto... \u00A1Un ritual est\u00E1 llamando a demonios para que nos ataquen! Debemos cerrar esa puerta infernal...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S105SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S105UN0024",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Sirena",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S105SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S105EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "T 1 Drama",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S105SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S105EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Consejero\n\u0022Nuestros batidores han rastreado los alrededores buscando a los no muertos... no se pudo encontrar ninguna de sus fuerzas.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S105SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S105EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Uther\n\u0022Es obvio que no hay no muertos en estas tierras...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S105SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S105EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Consejero\n\u0022\u00BFQu\u00E9 quereis decir, amo Bethrezen? \u00BF\u00A1No hemos venido aqu\u00ED para emboscarles!?\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S105SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S105EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Uther\n\u0022Yo no soy Bethrezen...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 3
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S105SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S105EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Consejero\n\u00BF\u00A1No eres Bethrezen!? Pero... todo este tiempo... \u00BFQu\u00E9 significa esto?\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 4
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S105SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S105EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Uther\n\u0022Pronto lo entender\u00E1s... \u00A1Asteroth! Aplasta a estos demonios de los planos inferiores. Ya no los queremos para nada, \u00A1\u00BFverdad?!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 5
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S105SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S105EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "T 1-2 Drama",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S105SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S105EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Asteroth\n\u0022\u00A1S\u00ED, reinaremos juntos! \u00A1No ser\u00E1n capaces de desafiarnos!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S105SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S105EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "OBJECT_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Destruir al se\u00F1or demonio Asteroth",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S105SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S105UN0027",
